stateDiagram-v2
    state "购物车" as CART
    state "待付款" as PENDING
    state "待审核" as REVIEW
    state "支付中" as PAYING
    state "已支付" as PAID
    state "已取消" as CANCELED
    state "拣货中" as PICKING
    state "已发货" as SHIPPED
    state "运输中" as IN_TRANSIT
    state "海关查验" as CUSTOMS
    state "海关扣留" as HELD
    state "已签收" as DELIVERED
    state "配送异常" as DELIVERY_EXC
    state "已退回" as RETURNED
    state "已完成" as COMPLETED
    state "退款中" as REFUNDING
    state "待退货" as WAIT_RETURN
    state "退货中" as RETURNING
    state "已退款" as REFUNDED

    [*] --> CART : 添加商品

    CART --> PENDING : 提交订单 POST /api/orders<br/>预占库存 · 核销优惠券
    CART --> [*] : 清空/过期

    PENDING --> CANCELED : 30min 超时<br/>UnpaidOrderCron 每5分钟
    PENDING --> CANCELED : 用户取消
    PENDING --> REVIEW : 仅 risk.mode=block<br/>且风控 review（支付前）
    PENDING --> PAYING : 发起支付<br/>POST /api/payment/create

    REVIEW --> PENDING : 审核通过
    REVIEW --> CANCELED : 审核驳回<br/>恢复库存 + 退还优惠券

    PAYING --> PENDING : 支付失败
    PAYING --> PAID : 支付成功<br/>PaymentSuccessService 统一入账

    PAID --> PICKING : 已付款直接进入发货流程
    PICKING --> SHIPPED : 出库完成<br/>生成运单号

    SHIPPED --> IN_TRANSIT : 物流揽收
    SHIPPED --> SHIPPED : 更新物流轨迹

    IN_TRANSIT --> CUSTOMS : 到达目的国
    CUSTOMS --> IN_TRANSIT : 查验放行
    CUSTOMS --> HELD : 查验异常
    HELD --> IN_TRANSIT : 补充资料通过

    IN_TRANSIT --> DELIVERED : 客户签收
    IN_TRANSIT --> DELIVERY_EXC : 地址/联系失败

    DELIVERY_EXC --> IN_TRANSIT : 重新配送
    DELIVERY_EXC --> RETURNED : 退回寄件人

    DELIVERED --> COMPLETED : 自动确认<br/>7天无售后

    DELIVERED --> REFUNDING : 申请退货退款
    REFUNDING --> WAIT_RETURN : 商家同意

    WAIT_RETURN --> RETURNING : 客户发货
    RETURNING --> RETURNED : 仓库签收
    RETURNED --> REFUNDING : 质检通过
    RETURNED --> DELIVERED : 质检不通过 → 退回客户

    REFUNDING --> REFUNDED : 退款完成<br/>原路返回

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING : 库存预占 30min<br/>超时取消跳过已发起网关支付的订单<br/>（shop_payments.status=0 且有 transaction_no）
    note right of CANCELED : 用户取消/超时/风控驳回<br/>共用 OrderCancellation<br/>恢复库存 · 退还优惠券
    note right of REVIEW : 审核在支付前<br/>通过→待付款 · 驳回→取消
    note right of PAYING : Stripe/PayPal/Klarna/Adyen
    note right of PAID : 订单 0→1 · 支付 0→1<br/>PlatformSettlements · 销量累加
    note right of IN_TRANSIT : Webhook 推送更新
    note right of DELIVERED : 7天自动确认收货
